    ""
    "GO AWAY!"

    "..."
    "EHH.. SORRY LAD."
    "I'VE JUST BEEN HAVIN' A LITTLE TROUBLE WITH"
    "THE PEOPLE THESE DAYS."

    "SOMETHIN'S FISHY HERE."
    "FIRST, ALL OF EVERYONE'S POWERCELLS WERE"
    "TAKEN FROM THEM, NOW EVERYONE'S TELLIN"
    "ME TO FISH FER THEM!"

    "YE BEST BE HELPIN' ME OUT, FRIENDS."
    ""
    ""
    ""

    "HERE, IF YE CAN LEARN TO CATCH SOME FISH,"
    "I'LL LET YE KEEP THIS OLD FISHIN' ROD AND LURE."
    ""
    ""

    "FIND A FISHIN SPOT ON THIS ISLAND, AND"
    "BRING BACK 10 PRECURSOR ORBS."
    ""
    "THERE'S BOUND TO BE ONE SOMEWHERE."
    
    ""
    ""
    ""
    ""))

