    "ABOUT THEM! YE MIGHT FIND YERSELF A"
    "LEGENDARY FISH, LAD."
    ""

    "GOLDEN HOURS RUN FROM 4 TO 6 AT DAWN,"
    "AND THE EVENING AS WELL."
    "MORE FISH STIR THEN, AND BETTER"
